src/staking/AbstractStakingStrategy.sol:_redeemShares:125|class=C21|High|_redeemShares trusts the caller-supplied isEscrowed flag instead of re-deriving it from _isWithdrawRequestPending(sharesOwner), so an account whose yield tokens are already escrowed in the withdraw request manager can reach the else branch and have convertSharesToYieldToken(sharesToRedeem) price its shares against the pooled PT balance still owned by other depositors, selling that pooled balance via _executeInstantRedemption while its escrowed claim stays fully finalizable — the same shares paid twice.|src/staking/AbstractStakingStrategy.sol
